Maple Glaze
via https://www.iheartnaptime.net/maple-glaze

3 Tablespoons unsalted butter
1/3 cup maple syrup
1/2 teaspoon vanilla extract
1 1/2 cups powdered sugar , plus more if needed
Pinch salt

In a small saucepan, melt 3 Tablespoons butter over medium heat. Whisk in the 1/3 cup maple syrup until melted. Remove from the heat. 

Whisk in 1/2 teaspoon vanilla, up to 1 1/2 cups powdered sugar, and pinch of salt until smooth.

Dip donuts into the glaze or drizzle on top of your favorite baked goods.
